ected, but once she starts talking about old literary works she can't stop."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a third-year student like Towa, but has already earned her credits and seems to be devoting herself to literary activities."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The club has two members: Dee and Serena."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c143199"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f7394030b1dbbe4c55834babbde8beaa468f2008b8c421e17569bd2e01d4262b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/5385878c612ff27cd217efa19c915da0f37858235cdf6e05ccb68e715a829981.webp","width":219,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"夏樹 柑菜","creatorId":"vndb:s11698","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11698","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11698","name":"笹本 菜津枝","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:98088","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c143202","characterName":"エリ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c143202"},"originalCharacterName":"エリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of Reika's entourage."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sent by the Tsukikage Clan, she is Reika's loyal servant."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Together with her partner Miri, she always accompanies Reika like a shadow."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c143202"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bdf3098dc9294fa3b901cd7bdbf4568738069fe925b9c22dae7163156f86e347.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/02dd1900eb843be6